           )
Maintainer: Niklas Lück <lueck@statistik.tu-dortmund.de>
Description: StabCell allows the generation of stable clusterings and sets of
             differentially expressed genes. It applies concepts from stability
             selection to arbitrary clustering and marker detection methods and
             offers an integrated approach for modelling.
